  "aboutContent": "Campus.Async, an association initiated by a UST scholar during the pandemic, blazes the trail for joint-school social networking. Its members hail from esteemed universities in Hong Kong, including HKU, HKUST, CUHK, CityU, PolyU, BUHK, and LingU.\n\nCampus.Async has emerged as one of Hong Kong's youngest, most distinguished, and well-organized joint-school social associations. Its inception aimed to provide a legitimate platform for not only holding activities in a systematic manner but also connecting students from diverse universities.\n\nThrough its unique blend of seasoned leadership, visionary outlook, and innovative approach, Campus.Async pioneers traditional social models. We espouse decentralized systems that foster social inclusion and are deeply committed to creating value for future generations.\n\nOur ultimate objective is to establish an association similar to Rotaract Clubs, which fosters connections among young adults, as there is currently no official application that unites all local universities with technical means.",
